 needs like shopping or where to eat. Some might feel the situation is hard to swallow, perhaps sticking their tongue out in frustration at the confusion. Ultimately, the goal is to balance public safety with effective addiction and mental health support for those struggling with substance abuse.\n\nP.P.S This summary reflects the transition from decriminalization to a new framework focused on treatment options where possible.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Oregon", "logprob": -7.152583e-06}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.05485736}, {"token": " unique", "logprob": -1.5355442}, {"token": " experiment", "logprob": -0.55583465}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.15327723}, {"token": " dec", "logprob": -0.013633498}, {"token": "riminal", "logprob": -1.4305125e-06}, {"token": "izing", "logprob": -4.768373e-07}, {"token": " hard", "logprob": -1.4172243}, {"token": " drugs", "logprob": -0.002479107}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.53356344}, {"token": " ending", "logprob": -0.2953476}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -0.039139416}, {"token": " Sunday", "logprob": -0.0011609973}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.29471946}, {"token": " marking", "logprob": -2.2698607}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.0032935676}, {"token": " shift", "logprob": -0.4061978}, {"token": " back", "logprob": -0.049083415}, {"token": " toward", "logprob": -1.0077026}, {"token": " criminal", "logprob": -0.010440482}, {"token": " penalties", "logprob": -0.040674753}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.00044504768}, {"token": " possessing", "logprob": -2.1201649}, {"token": " small", "logprob": -0.07897493}, {"token": " quantities", "logprob": -0.18270439}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.033063296}, {"token": " illicit", "logprob": -4.6531415}, {"token": " substances", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.00962626}, {"token": " This", "logprob": -1.760927}, {"token": " new", "logprob": -0.21782702}, {"token": " legislation", "logprob": -0.0350251}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0065122237}, {"token": " known", "